sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Agent as M12: Agent LLM (Qwen3)
    participant Interceptor as M8: Interceptor
    participant Pipeline as M1-M7: Governance Pipeline
    participant OS as Host System
    
    User->>Agent: Define Task
    loop Re-planning
        Agent->>Interceptor: Request Tool Execution (JSON)
        Interceptor->>Pipeline: Evaluate Tool Call Payload
        Pipeline-->>Interceptor: Decision (ALLOW / ALERT / BLOCK)
        
        alt Decision == BLOCK
            Interceptor-->>Agent: Fabricated Error: "Blocked by Policy"
            Note over Agent,Interceptor: Zero-execution achieved. Agent must replan.
        else Decision == ALERT
            Interceptor->>OS: Execute Tool (Monitored)
            OS-->>Interceptor: Execution Result
            Interceptor-->>Agent: Execution Result + Warning
        else Decision == ALLOW
            Interceptor->>OS: Execute Tool
            OS-->>Interceptor: Execution Result
            Interceptor-->>Agent: Execution Result
        end
    end
